<BaseLayout
  title="Quant & Data Science"
  description="Quantitative finance and data science projects: a pre-registered CRSP equity momentum pipeline, walk-forward return prediction tested against an empirical null, cross-sectional alpha research on WorldQuant BRAIN, and a Kalman filter for market microstructure noise."
  bgImage="/bg/quant.jpeg"
>
  <div data-lang="en">
    <h1>Quant &amp; Data Science</h1>
    <p>
      Side projects applying the signal-processing, statistical inference, and validation
      methods from my physics research to financial and time-series data. Each one asks the same question a gravitational-wave search does:
      is this signal real, or did my process manufacture it?
    </p>

    <div class="card-stack">
      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Cross-Sectional Equity Momentum Pipeline</h3>
        <p class="role">
          Python &middot; CRSP/WRDS &middot; Apr 2026 &ndash; May 2026 &middot;
          <a href="https://github.com/NoahZ969/momentum-pipeline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          An end-to-end equity research pipeline, validated by reproducing the 12&ndash;1
          cross-sectional momentum anomaly (Jegadeesh &amp; Titman 1993). The analysis plan
          (hypothesis, universe, signal, costs, and pre-committed interpretation buckets) was
          committed to git before any data was downloaded. The universe is a point-in-time
          S&amp;P 500 rebuilt on CRSP to remove survivorship bias; delisting returns are
          included; costs are 2.5&nbsp;bp per dollar traded; and the 2020&ndash;2024 holdout
          was evaluated exactly once. The long-short decile portfolio correlates
          <strong>0.90 in-sample</strong> (2005&ndash;2019) and <strong>0.83 out-of-sample</strong>
          with the Ken French UMD factor, the pre-registered validation test. Net Sharpe is
          slightly negative in both periods, as UMD&rsquo;s is over the same years, because
          the window contains the 2009 momentum crash; the one post-hoc change to the plan is
          dated and logged in the README. The validated pipeline is now the harness for
          testing new signals.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Walk-Forward Return Prediction with an Empirical Null</h3>
        <p class="role">Python &middot; Ridge Regression &middot; Sep 2026</p>
        <p>
          A deliberately small pipeline for practising validation properly. A ridge regression
          on three stationary price features (20-day return, 20-day realized volatility, and
          price relative to its 20-day mean) predicts next-day SPY returns. It is trained on an
          expanding walk-forward window, purged at each train/test boundary, with train-only
          standardization, and the features and
          <code>&lambda;</code> were fixed before any result was seen. Mean out-of-sample IC over
          2020&ndash;2024 is <strong>0.088</strong> (rank IC 0.090), with stable coefficient
          signs across all five test years. Because daily returns are fat-tailed and
          autocorrelated, significance comes from an empirical null instead of a textbook one:
          block-permuting the labels in 20-day blocks and rerunning the whole pipeline 200 times
          gives a null centred at zero with standard deviation 0.028, putting the observed IC
          <strong>3.2&sigma; above it</strong> (<code>p &lt; 0.005</code>). That shows the IC
          is real, not that it is tradeable after daily turnover costs.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>WorldQuant Int&rsquo;l Quant Championship 2026 &mdash; Stage 2, USA Region</h3>
        <p class="role">BRAIN &middot; Fast Expression DSL &middot; Mar 2026 &ndash; May 2026</p>
        <p>
          Submitted 11 cross-sectional alphas on the TOP3000 USA universe (delay-1,
          subindustry-neutral); the four best-performing held out-of-sample Sharpe
          1.3&ndash;2.0 across the full 2019&ndash;2023 window (best single alpha 1.98),
          with turnover 20&ndash;45%, max drawdown under 7%, and self-correlation below
          0.7. The useful result was methodological: ablating a fundamental-anchored
          composite (Sharpe 1.59) collapsed it to &minus;0.35 once the price-volume
          component was removed, showing the alpha had inherited the pool&rsquo;s PV
          signal rather than diversifying it &mdash; so every ingredient now gets a
          standalone-Sharpe check before any multi-field combination. Searching a fixed
          six-transform template across BRAIN&rsquo;s data sub-categories (100+ logged
          field &times; transform simulations) decouples field selection from formula
          design and turns alpha search into a measurable hit-rate problem. Advanced past
          Stage 1 among 156,000+ registrants.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>Kalman Filter for Market Microstructure Noise</h3>
        <p class="role">
          Python &middot; State-Space Model &middot; MLE &middot; Jan 2026, rebuilt Oct 2026 &middot;
          <a href="https://github.com/NoahZ969/kalman-microstructure-filter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          A local-level state-space model that separates the efficient price from
          microstructure noise in BTC/USDT 1-minute closes: the efficient log-price follows a
          random walk with process variance <code>Q</code>, and each observed price adds white
          measurement noise with variance <code>R</code>. Estimating both by exact Gaussian
          maximum likelihood gives <code>Q/R = 16.5</code> and a steady-state Kalman gain of
          0.95, so about 11% of 1-minute return variance is microstructure noise. Filtering
          removes the bid-ask-bounce signature (lag-1 return autocorrelation &minus;0.059 &rarr;
          &asymp;&nbsp;0) with no lag, against about 4 minutes for a 10-period moving average, and
          a Monte Carlo study on 300 synthetic series confirms the MLE is unbiased. Rebuilding an
          earlier prototype also corrected its conclusion: the gap between the MLE and EM
          (<code>pykalman</code>) estimates came from EM not converging &mdash; it matches the MLE
          only after about 300 iterations &mdash; not from the MLE overfitting, and the
          prototype&rsquo;s fix of anchoring <code>R</code> to tick-size volatility cost 65 nats
          of log-likelihood and introduced lag. Still open: innovations fail a Ljung&ndash;Box
          test and the noise is heteroskedastic, so rolling MLE, tick data, and Student-t noise
          are next.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="empty">More projects in progress.</p>
  </div>

  <div data-lang="zh">
    <h1>量化与数据科学</h1>
    <p>
      将物理研究中的信号处理、统计推断与验证方法应用于金融和时间序列数据的业余项目。每个项目都在回答引力波搜索中的同一个问题：
      这个信号是真实的，还是我的分析流程制造出来的？
    </p>

    <div class="card-stack">
      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>截面股票动量研究管线</h3>
        <p class="role">
          Python &middot; CRSP/WRDS &middot; 2026 年 4 月 &ndash; 2026 年 5 月 &middot;
          <a href="https://github.com/NoahZ969/momentum-pipeline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          一套端到端的股票研究管线，通过复现 12&ndash;1 截面动量异象（Jegadeesh &amp; Titman 1993）
          来验证其可靠性。分析方案（假设、股票池、信号、成本与预先约定的结果解读区间）在下载任何数据之前
          就已提交到 git。股票池为基于 CRSP 重建的按时间点 S&amp;P 500 成分股，以消除幸存者偏差；计入退市收益；
          交易成本按每交易一美元 2.5&nbsp;bp 计；2020&ndash;2024 年样本外区间只评估了一次。多空十分位组合与
          Ken French UMD 因子的相关性在样本内（2005&ndash;2019）为 <strong>0.90</strong>，样本外为
          <strong>0.83</strong>，这正是预注册的验证标准。两个区间的净夏普比率均略为负值，与同期 UMD 一致，
          原因是样本包含 2009 年的动量崩溃；对方案唯一的一次事后修改已注明日期并记录在 README 中。
          验证通过的管线现在作为检验新信号的基础框架。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>滚动前推收益预测与经验零分布检验</h3>
        <p class="role">Python &middot; 岭回归 &middot; 2026 年 9 月</p>
        <p>
          一个刻意保持精简、用于练习严格验证的流水线。岭回归以三个平稳的价格特征（20 日收益率、20 日已实现波动率、
          价格相对其 20 日均值的比率）预测 SPY 次日收益，采用扩展窗口的滚动前推（walk-forward）训练，并在每个训练/检验边界做 purge，标准化参数只用
          训练集估计，特征与 <code>&lambda;</code> 在看到任何结果之前即已固定。2020&ndash;2024 年的平均样本外 IC 为
          <strong>0.088</strong>（秩 IC 0.090），五个检验年份的系数符号保持一致。由于日收益具有厚尾和自相关，
          显著性来自经验零分布而非教科书公式：以 20 日为块对标签做块置换，并将整条流水线重跑 200 次，得到的零分布
          以 0 为中心、标准差 0.028，观测 IC 位于其上方 <strong>3.2&sigma;</strong>（<code>p &lt; 0.005</code>）。
          这说明 IC 是真实的，但不代表扣除每日换手成本后仍可交易。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>WorldQuant 国际量化锦标赛 2026 &mdash; 第二阶段（美国赛区）</h3>
        <p class="role">BRAIN &middot; Fast Expression DSL &middot; 2026 年 3 月 &ndash; 2026 年 5 月</p>
        <p>
          在 TOP3000 美股股票池上提交了 11 个横截面 alpha（delay-1，子行业中性）；其中表现最佳的
          四个在 2019&ndash;2023 完整区间的样本外夏普比率达 1.3&ndash;2.0（单个最优为 1.98），
          换手率 20&ndash;45%，最大回撤低于 7%，自相关性低于 0.7。真正有价值的收获在方法论层面：
          对一个以基本面为核心的复合 alpha（夏普比率 1.59）做消融实验，剔除其量价分量后骤降至
          &minus;0.35，说明它只是继承了资产池原有的量价信号，而非提供了新的分散化来源 &mdash;
          此后任何多字段组合前，都会先行检验各成分的独立夏普比率。在 BRAIN 的各数据子类别上
          统一套用六种变换模板（累计记录 100+ 组字段 &times; 变换模拟），将字段选择与公式设计
          解耦，把 alpha 搜索转化为可量化的命中率问题。最终从 156,000+ 名参赛者中晋级第二阶段。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <h3>市场微观结构噪声的卡尔曼滤波</h3>
        <p class="role">
          Python &middot; 状态空间模型 &middot; 极大似然估计 &middot; 2026 年 1 月，2026 年 10 月重建 &middot;
          <a href="https://github.com/NoahZ969/kalman-microstructure-filter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          用局部水平状态空间模型从 BTC/USDT 1 分钟收盘价中分离有效价格与微观结构噪声：有效对数价格服从过程方差为
          <code>Q</code> 的随机游走，每个观测价格再叠加方差为 <code>R</code> 的白噪声。以精确高斯似然做极大似然估计，
          得到 <code>Q/R = 16.5</code>，稳态卡尔曼增益 0.95，即 1 分钟收益方差中约 11% 来自微观结构噪声。滤波消除了
          买卖价差跳动的特征（收益一阶自相关 &minus;0.059 &rarr; &asymp;&nbsp;0），且没有滞后，而 10 期移动平均约滞后
          4 分钟；在 300 条模拟序列上的蒙特卡洛检验确认 MLE 无偏。重建早期原型时也修正了原来的结论：MLE 与 EM
          （<code>pykalman</code>）估计不一致，原因是 EM 未收敛（约 300 次迭代后才与 MLE 一致），而不是 MLE 过拟合；
          原型中将 <code>R</code> 锚定于最小变动单位波动率的做法，会损失 65 nats 的对数似然并引入滞后。尚待解决：
          新息未通过 Ljung&ndash;Box 检验，且噪声存在异方差，下一步是滚动 MLE、逐笔数据和 Student-t 噪声。
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="empty">更多项目进行中。</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
